spec VisitorSnapshot.tla
check INVARIANTS NoSecretPublished FailureKeepsPrevious PublishedCountsAreValidated ArchivedHistoryRetained
reach PublishedCounts | Success
reach FailedFetch | Failed
run Success | HasCredentials=TRUE HistoryOk=TRUE FetchOk=TRUE
run Failed | HasCredentials=TRUE HistoryOk=TRUE FetchOk=FALSE
run HistoryUnavailable | HasCredentials=TRUE HistoryOk=FALSE FetchOk=TRUE
run Unconfigured | HasCredentials=FALSE HistoryOk=TRUE FetchOk=TRUE
